'''Gathering Shadows''' is a niche [[Spells|spell]] that makes the object it is drawn on disappear into shadow.

==Description==
The spell consists of a central vision sigil, with eye sigils located on 4 of it's eight points. Bend sigils are located just off of the 4 remaining points. The spell causes the object the spell is drawn on to absorb all light that hits it, allowing the user to conceal themselves within the shadows by covering themselves with the object.

==Usage==
Gathering shadows was first seen as a component of the [[Mirror Cloak of Borrowshade|mirror cloak of borrowshade spell]] when Eunie was inspecting the inside of the cloak during [[The Sincerity of the Shield]].{{Ref|m|21|19}} The spell was then seen in it's entirety when Eunie was explaining the spell to [[Agott]], [[Riche]], and [[Alaira]].{{Ref|m|21|22}} Not long after, the spell was seen as a component of the [[Cloak Spell|cloak spell]] used in [[Sasaran|Sasaran's]] magic [[Sasaran's Cloak|cloak]], which he uses almost every time he appears.{{Ref|m|27|22}}

==Trivia==
* Gathering shadows is included in the [[Mirror Cloak of Borrowshade|mirror cloak of borrowshade]] alongside [[Mirror Spell|mirror]].
* Gathering shadows is also included in the [[Cloak Spell]].


